@startuml

title PENA POC 01 — Runtime Configuration Model

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false

skinparam class {
  BorderColor #2F5597
  BackgroundColor #F8FBFF
  ArrowColor #444444
}

skinparam artifact {
  BorderColor #666666
  BackgroundColor #FFFCE8
}

artifact "config/poc01.yaml" as YAML
artifact ".env / secrets" as ENV

class AppConfig {
  +run_id
  +topic
  +environment
  +max_articles
}

class SourceConfig {
  +input_type
  +input_path
  +rss_url
  +source_name
}

class ModelConfig {
  +provider
  +model_name
  +temperature
  +max_tokens
}

class DigestConfig {
  +output_format
  +output_path
  +summary_style
  +include_uncertainties
}

class ObservabilityConfig {
  +log_level
  +report_path
  +record_prompts
  +record_model_metadata
}

class ScoringConfig {
  +trust_rules_path
  +relevance_threshold
  +novelty_weight
  +source_weight
}

class OutputConfig {
  +digest_directory
  +reports_directory
  +learning_directory
}

YAML --> AppConfig
YAML --> SourceConfig
YAML --> ModelConfig
YAML --> DigestConfig
YAML --> ObservabilityConfig
YAML --> ScoringConfig
YAML --> OutputConfig

ENV --> ModelConfig : API keys / provider secrets

AppConfig --> SourceConfig : selects inputs
AppConfig --> ModelConfig : selects model
AppConfig --> DigestConfig : controls digest
AppConfig --> ObservabilityConfig : controls reporting
AppConfig --> ScoringConfig : controls scoring
DigestConfig --> OutputConfig
ObservabilityConfig --> OutputConfig

note bottom of AppConfig
Configuration gives POC 01 flexibility
without changing code.
end note

note right of ENV
Secrets should not be committed.
Only .env.example belongs in the repository.
end note

@enduml
